 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.rule",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.8,
   "text": "In this town, everybody has two birthdays. Their own, and the Extra."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.weeka",
   "start": 3.8,
   "end": 4.8,
   "text": "Mine is in March."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.weekb",
   "start": 4.8,
   "end": 7.3333,
   "text": "My Extra is in April, and the whole street comes."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.count",
   "start": 7.3333,
   "end": 8.9,
   "text": "Twelve years old. Thirteen candles."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.chair",
   "start": 8.9,
   "end": 11.9333,
   "text": "And one more chair at the table than there are people in my house."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.whya",
   "start": 11.9333,
   "end": 14.2333,
   "text": "Nobody explains the Extra. Not my teacher."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.whyb",
   "start": 14.2333,
   "end": 15.5,
   "text": "Not the man at the church."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.muma",
   "start": 15.5,
   "end": 17.9,
   "text": "\"Why the extra candle?\" \"Because it is the Extra.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "2.mumb",
   "start": 17.9,
   "end": 19.0,
   "text": "Then she cut the cake."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.slicea",
   "start": 19.0,
   "end": 21.2667,
   "text": "The first slice goes on the plate at the empty chair."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.sliceb",
   "start": 21.2667,
   "end": 22.3,
   "text": "Nobody eats it."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.towna",
   "start": 22.3,
   "end": 23.4667,
   "text": "Every house does it."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.townb",
   "start": 23.4667,
   "end": 25.8333,
   "text": "I have watched it through every window on this street."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.cup",
   "start": 25.8333,
   "end": 30.0333,
   "text": "There is a cupboard in the hall with a present in it for every year I have been alive."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.opena",
   "start": 30.0333,
   "end": 32.1333,
   "text": "I have never opened one. I asked once."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.openb",
   "start": 32.1333,
   "end": 33.9,
   "text": "My dad put the key in his pocket."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.worna",
   "start": 33.9,
   "end": 36.4667,
   "text": "The cushion on the empty chair is worn flat on one side."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.wornb",
   "start": 36.4667,
   "end": 37.9667,
   "text": "Somebody sits there a lot."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.plates",
   "start": 37.9667,
   "end": 40.9667,
   "text": "Four plates for three people. Every night. Not only birthdays."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.beaa",
   "start": 40.9667,
   "end": 43.3,
   "text": "Bea lives on the corner. Her Extra is in June."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.beab",
   "start": 43.3,
   "end": 44.9333,
   "text": "Her present goes in a cupboard too."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.gifta",
   "start": 44.9333,
   "end": 46.6,
   "text": "She has never looked at hers either."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.giftb",
   "start": 46.6,
   "end": 48.1333,
   "text": "I thought she was scared of the dark."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.aska",
   "start": 48.1333,
   "end": 49.7333,
   "text": "\"Whose chair is it?\" I asked her."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.askb",
   "start": 49.7333,
   "end": 52.0333,
   "text": "\"It is not a person,\" she said. That is worse."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.scareda",
   "start": 52.0333,
   "end": 53.4333,
   "text": "She was not scared of the chair."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.scaredb",
   "start": 53.4333,
   "end": 54.9333,
   "text": "She was scared of me touching it."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.brothera",
   "start": 54.9333,
   "end": 57.7667,
   "text": "So I decided it was my brother. The one who came before."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.brotherb",
   "start": 57.7667,
   "end": 58.6333,
   "text": "The one they wanted."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.jealousa",
   "start": 58.6333,
   "end": 61.1,
   "text": "The dead one gets a cake and a present every year."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.jealousb",
   "start": 61.1,
   "end": 63.4333,
   "text": "I get a cupboard I am not allowed to open."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.rulea",
   "start": 63.4333,
   "end": 65.1333,
   "text": "There is one rule at an Extra."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.ruleb",
   "start": 65.1333,
   "end": 66.5,
   "text": "You do not touch the chair."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.darea",
   "start": 66.5,
   "end": 69.2333,
   "text": "You do not blow the candle. You do not eat the slice."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.dareb",
   "start": 69.2333,
   "end": 70.6,
   "text": "You do not move the plate."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.muma",
   "start": 70.6,
   "end": 72.8667,
   "text": "My mum watched me all night at my last Extra."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.mumb",
   "start": 72.8667,
   "end": 74.1667,
   "text": "Not the cake. Me."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.enough",
   "start": 74.1667,
   "end": 76.3,
   "text": "This year I had had enough of the dead one."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.blow",
   "start": 76.3,
   "end": 78.1,
   "text": "I blew out the candle that was not mine."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.eata",
   "start": 78.1,
   "end": 80.0667,
   "text": "Then I ate the slice off the empty plate."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.eatb",
   "start": 80.0667,
   "end": 81.6667,
   "text": "It tasted like my own birthday cake."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.quiet",
   "start": 81.6667,
   "end": 84.3667,
   "text": "The room went quiet the way a room goes quiet when a plate breaks."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.facea",
   "start": 84.3667,
   "end": 85.4667,
   "text": "My dad did not shout."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.faceb",
   "start": 85.4667,
   "end": 87.1333,
   "text": "He turned the chair to face the wall."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.facec",
   "start": 87.1333,
   "end": 88.4333,
   "text": "Then the neighbours went home."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.morning",
   "start": 88.4333,
   "end": 92.2,
   "text": "In the morning, every house on the street had a chair facing the wall on its porch."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.walk",
   "start": 92.2,
   "end": 95.6,
   "text": "Nobody said anything to me at school. Bea sat with somebody else."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.cupboarda",
   "start": 95.6,
   "end": 98.1,
   "text": "I opened the cupboard with a spoon. Thirteen presents."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.cupboardb",
   "start": 98.1,
   "end": 99.2,
   "text": "All of them my size."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.tag",
   "start": 99.2,
   "end": 102.0667,
   "text": "Every tag said the same thing. \"For the year you were given.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.muma",
   "start": 102.0667,
   "end": 103.7667,
   "text": "My mum found me sitting under them."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.mumb",
   "start": 103.7667,
   "end": 106.3,
   "text": "She sat down on the floor. \"You are old enough now.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.deal",
   "start": 106.3,
   "end": 110.0333,
   "text": "In this town, when a baby comes too early, the town has one way to keep him."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.years",
   "start": 110.0333,
   "end": 113.2667,
   "text": "Every family gives up one year. One birthday. One Extra."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.poola",
   "start": 113.2667,
   "end": 115.3333,
   "text": "They pool them. They spend them on the child."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.poolb",
   "start": 115.3333,
   "end": 117.0,
   "text": "That is the year he is not owed."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.mea",
   "start": 117.0,
   "end": 120.0,
   "text": "I was born at twenty-six weeks. The doctor gave me a night."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.meb",
   "start": 120.0,
   "end": 120.3667,
   "text": "Maybe."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.minea",
   "start": 120.3667,
   "end": 122.6333,
   "text": "Every empty chair on this street is my chair."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.mineb",
   "start": 122.6333,
   "end": 125.8,
   "text": "Every unopened present is a birthday I was not meant to have."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.whya",
   "start": 125.8,
   "end": 128.2667,
   "text": "That is why nobody here is the age they should be."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.whyb",
   "start": 128.2667,
   "end": 130.5667,
   "text": "They are all one year short. I am the year."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.lista",
   "start": 130.5667,
   "end": 132.3667,
   "text": "The candle. The chair. The fourth plate."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.listb",
   "start": 132.3667,
   "end": 133.9,
   "text": "The cushion worn flat on one side."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.sat",
   "start": 133.9,
   "end": 137.4667,
   "text": "My mum sat in that chair every night for twelve years, so she could look at the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.gifta",
   "start": 137.4667,
   "end": 139.4,
   "text": "The presents were never for a dead brother."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.giftb",
   "start": 139.4,
   "end": 141.3,
   "text": "They were every year I could have missed."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.backa",
   "start": 141.3,
   "end": 142.8,
   "text": "I did not open one of them."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.backb",
   "start": 142.8,
   "end": 144.5,
   "text": "I put the key back in my dad's hand."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.cake",
   "start": 144.5,
   "end": 147.5667,
   "text": "At the next Extra I lit the candle, and my dad blew it out for me."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.agea",
   "start": 147.5667,
   "end": 149.6333,
   "text": "He is forty-four. He should be forty-five."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.ageb",
   "start": 149.6333,
   "end": 150.8333,
   "text": "He says he spent it well."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.like",
   "start": 150.8333,
   "end": 154.2667,
   "text": "Like this video if somebody spent a year on you and never once mentioned it."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.loopa",
   "start": 154.2667,
   "end": 156.3333,
   "text": "In this town, everybody has two birthdays."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.loopb",
   "start": 156.3333,
   "end": 157.9,
   "text": "Mine is the one they bought."
  }
 ],
